[{"client_msg_id":"484b6cf5-146f-4971-975f-58f4f7d177cd","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"なるほどStatic generatorだったのか。\nよさそう","ts":"1636520295.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eIee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd7b701e-c2fd-40a7-be73-28ccb8990c38","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"正直型が活かせるものはtsにどんどん頼るのありかもしれないという感覚","ts":"1636517876.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K8xuY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa6308cf-0e51-4463-93a9-e6f58093e1f9","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"aws-cdkはインフラの設定項目のバリデーションがTypeScriptの型システムのチェックにマッピングされていて考えた人は天才だと思った (もちろんtsの型システムでカバーできないことはある (数値の範囲とか) が、tsを書くのと同じ感覚でインフラ設定を作っていくのはめちゃ楽だった)","ts":"1636517586.015900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mHH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7455f8f-01b6-4519-8c33-5a06354f448b","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"(正確には .tf.json だった。 \u003chttps://www.terraform.io/docs/language/syntax/json.html\u003e 。 tf も使えるし、 tflint もちゃんと対応していそうだった)","ts":"1636516955.013100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Terraform by HashiCorp: JSON Configuration Syntax - Configuration Language - Terraform by HashiCorp","id":1,"title":"JSON Configuration Syntax - Configuration Language - Terraform by HashiCorp","title_link":"https://www.terraform.io/docs/language/syntax/json.html","text":"Details about the JSON-compatible Terraform language syntax, including file structure, expression mapping, and blocks.","thumb_url":"https://www.terraform.io/assets/images/og-image-c18d275f.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Terraform by HashiCorp","service_icon":"https://www.terraform.io/assets/images/favicons/apple-touch-icon-5c2d0048.png","thumb_width":2400,"thumb_height":1254,"from_url":"https://www.terraform.io/docs/language/syntax/json.html","original_url":"https://www.terraform.io/docs/language/syntax/json.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RrOwY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75e0a78f-e309-4e17-b40c-256d6ada2266","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"お、なるほど\n便利そう","ts":"1636515425.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pCD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da0bfb92-a650-4888-9431-137921fe67aa","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"tf lsp より tsserver 使えるのは嬉しい、基本的に強いというのもあり、型つけたいところに型つけまくって楽しめる","ts":"1636514818.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E=9hc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bd55bf7-be6d-449d-83df-ad911a0b1a8d","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"AWS が aws-cdk という CloudFormation static generator に相当するのを出して、そのベースに TS からいろんな言語のツール生成する jsii というのがあり、それを使っているのが cdktf","ts":"1636514741.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czNMc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"daa6e520-19c3-4e6f-91c8-f82d15662914","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"HCLを生成するというアプローチは良い","ts":"1636514646.010400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nSltE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0453f214-301e-43d8-8456-a1ba02289064","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"cdktf ですよね、今バリバリ使っているんですが、 static HCL generator なので HCL に対して使えているツールは基本使えます","ts":"1636514556.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EGtH0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58d3e692-091d-4a3e-a5d7-5a2ea384c54f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあHCLそのものは単純だとは思うんですが、TSの諸々に乗っかるのとHCLのツールチェインに乗っかるのとどっちが楽かという感じですね\n手癖で書けないうちは手癖で書ける言語で書きたいけど、そうしてるとシンタックスが一生馴染まないという","ts":"1636513590.008700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+t2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1308059-e014-4da8-9b47-98e73a90cc53","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"学習コストについてはHCLそのもののsyntax別に難しいとは思わないけど慣れの部分が大きそうとは思う。","ts":"1636507312.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1bF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3e35eab-50d9-487d-9b7d-2319ee4d48a1","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"関連ツールとかLSP含めてもろもろHCL前提のものが多いのでHCLでいいんじゃないかなという気がする。\ntfsecとかtflintなんかも使えないし…","ts":"1636507244.006000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+OX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cb37bf6-7f65-433a-b44c-623d679ab40a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ただ素直にHCL書くのとどっちが楽なんですかね","ts":"1636498951.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3IVDQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb997d6b-d25c-4e2f-8257-0af431f5e86e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kt3k/status/1458108583376084995\u003e\nHCL覚えるコスト低くはないのでありがたい……","ts":"1636498852.004200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kt3k|@kt3k\u003e: へー terraform が typescript で書けるやつが始まってるのか・・・ \u003chttps://www.terraform.io/docs/cdktf/concepts/providers-and-resources.html\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"Yoshiya Hinosawa","author_subname":"@kt3k","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kt3k/status/1458108583376084995","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1437999567711002629/iR7ktUeF_normal.jpg","text":"へー terraform が typescript で書けるやつが始まってるのか・・・ \u003chttps://www.terraform.io/docs/cdktf/concepts/providers-and-resources.html\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1636475151,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kt3k/status/1458108583376084995","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kt3k/status/145810858337608499